      <header class="page-header">
        <h1>Passive vs Active Dead Hang: Differences and When to Use Each</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Two versions of the same exercise load the shoulders differently. Pick the one that matches your goal.</p>
      </header>
    </div>
    <article class="article">
      <div class="article-meta">
        <a href="/about/" class="author-link">
          <span class="author-avatar">DH</span>
          <span>DeadHangs Team</span>
        </a>
        <span class="meta-sep">·</span>
